                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Animated Spiral Art</h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                            Let's create beautiful animated spirals using trigonometry and time-based animation:
                        </p>
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 relative">
                            <button onclick="copyCode(this)" class="absolute top-2 right-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded transition-colors duration-200">
